# Calendar MCP server (read-only)
#
# Deliberately not OAuth. Calendar scopes are sensitive, so an unverified app
# stays in Google's Testing mode where refresh tokens expire every 7 days —
# unusable for an always-on agent. The secret iCal address never expires, and
# being read-only means no agent can alter the calendar.
#
# Get it from calendar.google.com -> Settings -> pick the calendar ->
# Integrate calendar -> "Secret address in iCal format".
#
# That URL grants read access to the whole calendar, so prefer the _FILE form
# and keep the file at mode 600. The URL then never appears in config or logs.
CALENDAR_ICS_URL_FILE=/home/lfiathan/.openclaw/secrets/calendar-ics-url

# Fallback if you would rather inline it (not recommended).
# CALENDAR_ICS_URL=

CALENDAR_TZ=Asia/Jakarta
CALENDAR_CACHE_SECONDS=300
